ition", "content": "not having enough space "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The seats are so cramped."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stretch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the act of stretching your body"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Doing leg stretches at the back of the plane can help."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aisle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a passage between seats to walk"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Walking up and down the aisle is a good idea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "memory"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the ability to recall the past"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Jetlag can affect your memory."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob08aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find 3 health pamphlets online or in your neighborhood in English."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the pamphlet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down notes about the pamphlet like <span class=\"italic\">definition</span>, <span class=\"italic\">symptoms</span> and <span class=\"italic\">treatment</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose one pamphlet and give a presentation to a partner on the information."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find three health pamphlets online or in my area."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write notes on health information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give a presentation on the information in a health pamphlet."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob08re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le14ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Excuse me, could I get some advice?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Sure, what can I help you with?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I am on the next flight to the States. I am a little concerned about jetlag.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: We have some pamphlets here on travel and your health. Why don't you take one of these?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh wonderful, thanks.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le14ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: The pamphlet includes some helpful tips and ideas.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Like what?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Well, you should drink plenty of fluids before and while you are in the air.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, you don't want to get dehydrated.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: No, and it's a good idea to move around as much as you can during the flight.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What do you suggest?", "id": 2, "time": "16500", "image": "engenn5le14ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Walking up and down the aisle and doing some stretches at the back of the plane can help with your circulation.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Those seats on the airplane are so small and cramped!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Yes, try to get some rest on the flight so you aren't too tired when you arrive at your destination.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, I can hear them calling my flight number. Thanks for the pamphlet.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Safe travels.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Shokran!", "id": 3, "time": "34300", "image": "engenn5le14ob08re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le14ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}]}}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn5le14ob08re4aud01"}]}, {"id": 4, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn5le14ob08re6aud04"}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write a small pamphlet."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write about common health problems. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can give advice. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What does being jetlagged mean? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What should you do to prevent jetlag?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Writing Spot